{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15820","headline":"题空山人石室 · 崔峒","name":"题空山人石室","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早晚悟无生，头陀不到城。\n云山知夏腊，猨鸟见修行。\n地僻无溪路，人寻逐水声。\n年年深谷里，谁识远公名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}